{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2023-03-15 08:30:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES AND ADDITIONS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND. , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NISOURCE (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MICHAEL LUHRS TO THE NISOURCE EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM, ALONG WITH A RECONFIGURATION OF LEADERSHIP RESPONSIBILITIES FOR SEVERAL OTHERS ON THAT TEAM.'}